    - target: {fileID: 2983888460913038735, guid: a20d392110ed346429a00c9f2a7d9a39, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'A man in golden garments confronts you.

        "Stop, my friend,
        and consider. The end times are the curtain call for all of us together.
        When will humanity ever be as one as it is now?"


        He is an ambassador
        of the enemy!'
